 E | ['determinism-replay']\nED.DEBUG.menus | Debug menus & overlays | visual-debugging-tools | E | ['observability-telemetry']\nED.AI.generative | Generative asset tools & editor copilots | ai-assisted-authoring | M | \nED.AI.processing | ML-assisted processing (retopology, rigging, UV, LOD) | ai-assisted-authoring | M | \nED.AI.provenance | Provenance & licensing of generated content | ai-assisted-authoring | M | ['certification-compliance']\nPRF.LOAD.load-time | Load-time optimization | loading-streaming-performance | E | \nPRF.LOAD.hitches | Hitch & stutter elimination (PSO, streaming, GC) | loading-streaming-performance | E | \nPRF.LOAD.io | IO throughput analysis | loading-streaming-performance | E | ['async-io-storage']\nPRF.LOAD.startup | Startup time | loading-streaming-performance | E | \nXC.ITER.protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration | E | \nXC.ITER.live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration | E | \nXC.ITER.coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration | E | \nXC.ITER.metrics | Iteration-time metrics (edit → see latency) | hot-reload-iteration | E | ['developer-experience-docs']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1d8de432-84cc-48d3-aaa2-841021a6752f","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:46:03.347Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0327a951-1024-4c57-a362-fd1b63457c2d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
